version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Terrestrial and airborne laser scanning processing for forest ecology and
  remote sensing: ground classification, tree segmentation, quantitative
  structure models, ray-traced voxels, canopy metrics, coregistration,
  change detection and airborne lidar, with a Rust core, a Python API and a
  command-line tool.
